                <mxCell id="zNzkGlOS1Pj8zT7MWDbS-2" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;the original amount;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;the creation date;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;the expiration date;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;the description;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;if the expense is recurring;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;if the expense is recurring, what is its recurrence?;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;the expense category;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;the cash source;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;the expense type&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;bills to pay;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;service contracting&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;the external code to reference the expense&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" parent="zNzkGlOS1Pj8zT7MWDbS-3" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry y="116.99999999999999" width="300" height="273" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="lVsxYJrHT0ziq54voVGJ-0" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Requisits&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;expense registration;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;categorize an expense;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;inform whether the expense is recurring;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;define the recurrence if the expense is recurring;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;If an expense is recurring, it must be mandatory to define the time in which it occurs again: day of the month, weekly, bimonthly, semi-annual, annual, etc.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;define the original amount&amp;nbsp;and the amount paid.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;it must relate the expense to the cash source of the funds;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;it&amp;nbsp;must relate the origin of the expense:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;bills to pay;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;service contracting&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;it status manage:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Paid;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Open;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Expired;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Canceled;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Reversed.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;It save the expiration date and status manage from this date;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;It must&amp;nbsp;store a link to possible attachments;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;It&amp;nbsp;must have specific actions for the following status changes:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Paid;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Canceled;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Reversed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;When an expense has a status of Canceled or Paid, it cannot be changed;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The API must make it possible to store links to attachments for each of the specific actions;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The API should allow you to list expenses by filtering the result by:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;status;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;the source of funds;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;category;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;dates;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;recurrence type;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;the record ID of the cash register from which the resource originated&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1" vertex="1">
