                <mxCell id="Xec_dI3AxyZPSjPY3MIW-3" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Expense Categorization&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Expenses can be categorized by association between the expense and the category. An expense can be associated with more than one category.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="Xec_dI3AxyZPSjPY3MIW-12" vertex="1">
